## Java Stream API

 Java Stream API Tutorial - Video Version 
 Java Stream Definition 
 Stream Processing 
 Obtain a Stream 
 Terminal and Non-Terminal Operations 
 Non-Terminal Operations 
 filter() 
 map() 
 flatMap() 
 distinct() 
 limit() 
 peek() 
 Terminal Operations 
 anyMatch() 
 allMatch() 
 noneMatch() 
 collect() 
 count() 
 findAny() 
 findFirst() 
 forEach() 
 min() 
 max() 
 reduce() 
 toArray() 
 Concatenate Streams 
 Create Stream From Array 
 Java Stream API Critique 
 Batch, Not Streaming 
